### Qdrant REST walkthrough for the viva (VS Code REST Client extension).
### Demonstrates collection, payload index, upsert, retrieve, filtered query,
### payload update, delete, scroll and count using throw-away demo_reports.
@qdrant = http://127.0.0.1:6333

### 1. Create a 4-dimensional cosine collection
PUT {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vectors": { "size": 4, "distance": "Cosine" } }

### 2. Create a payload index
PUT {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports/index
Content-Type: application/json

{ "field_name": "company_id", "field_schema": "integer" }

### 3. Upsert four points (two companies; three concepts)
PUT {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports/points?wait=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "points": [
  { "id": 1, "vector": [0.9,0.1,0.0,0.1], "payload": { "company_id": 1, "title": "IDOR on invoices" } },
  { "id": 2, "vector": [0.85,0.15,0.05,0.1], "payload": { "company_id": 1, "title": "Other tenants invoice PDFs" } },
  { "id": 3, "vector": [0.0,0.9,0.3,0.0], "payload": { "company_id": 1, "title": "Stored XSS in bio" } },
  { "id": 4, "vector": [0.9,0.1,0.0,0.1], "payload": { "company_id": 2, "title": "IDOR at another company" } }
] }

### 4. Retrieve a point
GET {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports/points/1

### 5. Same-company nearest neighbours, excluding point 1
POST {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports/points/query
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": [0.9,0.1,0.0,0.1],
  "filter": { "must": [{ "key": "company_id", "match": { "value": 1 } }], "must_not": [{ "has_id": [1] }] },
  "limit": 3, "with_payload": true }

### 6. Payload-only update
POST {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports/points/payload?wait=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "payload": { "status": "DUPLICATE" }, "points": [2] }

### 7. Delete point 3
POST {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports/points/delete?wait=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "points": [3] }

### 8. Scroll and count
POST {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports/points/scroll
Content-Type: application/json

{ "limit": 10, "with_payload": true }

POST {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports/points/count
Content-Type: application/json

{ "exact": true }

### 9. Inspect and clean up the demo collection
GET {{qdrant}}/collections/vulnerability_reports
DELETE {{qdrant}}/collections/demo_reports
